  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "Game Description and Volume",
   "body": [
    {
     "intro": "BunnyBarTalk is a quick and easy command input mini-game that lets you get to know the women at BunnyBar.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n●Game description<br />\r\nWhen you successfully input a command, the tension of the woman in the game will increase. If you make her drink alcohol and she gets drunk...?<br />\r\nBe careful not to make a mistake, because it will lower the tension.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n●Volume<br />\r\nTotal 5 stages<br />\r\nTotal H-animation 5 kinds<br />\r\nEstimated play time 15~25 minutes"
    }
   ]
  }
